1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:06,676
The Subcommittee on Livestock and
Fisheries Quality and Standards

2
00:00:06,676 --> 00:00:11,479
held Meeting No. 20/2569 on
Wednesday, 18 November 2026.

3
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:18,360
At 2 p.m., in committee room CA
319, 3rd floor, Parliament House.

4
00:00:18,440 --> 00:00:23,220
Mr. Ruchu Kaewlai, the subcommittee
chair, presided over the meeting.

5
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:28,054
This subcommittee is part
of the Senate Committee

6
00:00:28,054 --> 00:00:30,558
on Agriculture and Cooperatives.

7
00:00:30,639 --> 00:00:34,600
The committee chair is
Mr. Sountorn Chaokijka.

8
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,960
The committee's three current
subcommittees are chaired as follows.

9
00:00:40,040 --> 00:00:43,600
Livestock and Fisheries:
Mr. Ruchu Kaewlai.

10
00:00:43,680 --> 00:00:49,860
Water Management in Farm Areas Outside
Irrigation Zones: Miss Amorn Sribunnak.

11
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:54,280
And Integrated Agricultural
Networks: Mr. Choocheep Auekarn.

12
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:59,559
The meeting considered
the draft study report on

13
00:00:59,559 --> 00:01:03,659
integrated, sustainable
elimination of rabies.

14
00:01:03,740 --> 00:01:07,430
The subcommittee has
drafted the summary,

15
00:01:07,430 --> 00:01:10,400
observations and recommendations.

16
00:01:10,480 --> 00:01:14,620
It brainstormed six key recommendations.

17
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:16,500
Law.

18
00:01:16,580 --> 00:01:17,840
Integration.

19
00:01:17,920 --> 00:01:19,620
Databases.

20
00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:25,400
More stray-animal shelters that meet
standards, including quarantine areas.

21
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:29,658
Public relations to
raise public awareness.

22
00:01:29,738 --> 00:01:34,502
And budget support for
the agencies concerned,

23
00:01:34,502 --> 00:01:38,438
for staff, tools and modern equipment.

24
00:01:39,439 --> 00:01:44,025
The meeting also reviewed
the summary of a study visit

25
00:01:44,025 --> 00:01:48,951
on rabies prevention and control
and stray-dog management,

26
00:01:48,951 --> 00:01:52,858
in Uthai Thani province,
on 12 to 13 November.

27
00:01:52,939 --> 00:01:59,004
Further recommendations: more
veterinarians to care for stray animals.

28
00:01:59,084 --> 00:02:04,559
Budget for more modern
sterilisation tools and equipment.

29
00:02:04,639 --> 00:02:08,165
A legal review to define
stray dogs more clearly,

30
00:02:08,165 --> 00:02:10,900
as a basis for sterilisation criteria.

31
00:02:10,981 --> 00:02:14,446
And rules for caring
for dogs or cats that

32
00:02:14,446 --> 00:02:17,498
have owners but are not looked after.

33
00:02:18,499 --> 00:02:21,598
This summary is based on the
subcommittee's newsletter.

34
00:02:21,678 --> 00:02:24,515
Meeting minutes and reports
are available through

35
00:02:24,515 --> 00:02:27,178
the channels of the
Secretariat of the Senate.

